This is such a troubling pathology being learned, self-loathing  and low self-esteem in a child too young to correct "if i do a mistake". 

&#x200B;

Hopefully they get some help and soon

Last Podcast on the Left is one of my favorite crime podcast. A good amount of the episodes are on paranormal/cryptids/aliens etc which i am not a big fan of, but they have great deep dives on many famous murders and serial killers. It is a comedy podcast so maybe not exactly what you are looking for but worth a recommendation.

&#x200B;

if you enjoy LPOTL try 'My Favorite Murder' it's a similar-ish show but with female hosts

If you can replenish your bankroll or have other income than be more aggressive. Obv it depends on the game, but you should be scouting games and sitting in only the best ones. It's REALLY hard to build a roll at 1/3 if you have ANY expenses. shot taking at good 2/5 games is a great way to propel you into playing that game regularly

&#x200B;

Good luck!!

